<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in light trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 586.16, down 1.78.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 276 to 239.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.05.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 14,731,985 compared with 16,820,220 on Monday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
